new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0c57cb1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/docs/cli/register.md
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+---
+title: dekit register
+cli: dekit register
+order: 13
+related: [cli/spawn, cli/start, start/runners]
+---
+
+Registers a process task without starting its command or writing
+`dekit.yaml`. The task takes the project's defaults except `autorestart`,
+which is always `never`, and gets the `dynamic` tag.
+
+The target must be an exact project task path. `--cwd` is required and
+must resolve to an existing working directory. `--label` sets the display
+label only when creating the task.
+
+Repeated registration succeeds only when the stored command arguments and
+canonical working directory match. It preserves the task ID, current state,
+pinning, and display label. A conflicting definition fails instead of
+replacing the task.
+
+`--start` verifies the definition and starts the task in the same kernel
+operation. It starts an idle task without restarting an already active one.
+
+:::usage
+
+```sh
+dekit register scripts/test --cwd "$PWD" --label test -- npm run test
+dekit register scripts/test --cwd "$PWD" --start -- npm run test
+```
